      "text": "The function H is differentiable, and H(t) gives the temperature inside an oven, in degrees Fahrenheit, at time t minutes. Selected values of H(t) are given in the table. Using the average rate of change of H over the interval \\( 2 \\le t \\le 11 \\), approximate \\( H'(8) \\). Give the exact value of the approximation and indicate units of measure.",
